# API 参考

`{{API_BASE}}`。未标「公开」的都要 `Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}`。

## 公开

| 方法 | 路径 | 说明 |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/healthz` `/readyz` | 探活 |
| POST | `/auth/register` | `{username,email,password}` → 201 |
| POST | `/auth/login` | `{username,password}` → `{token,refresh_token,user}` |
| POST | `/auth/refresh` | `{refresh_token}` |
| POST | `/auth/logout` | `{refresh_token}` |
| GET | `/agent-pack/version` | `{version,released_at,notes}`；与本地 VERSION 比较，更大则重拉 pack |
| GET | `/agent-pack/{token}` | 本 pack；`?format=md` 为 Markdown |

登录 JWT 约 15 分钟；**本 Agent 令牌长期有效**，不要混用短 JWT。

## 我

| 方法 | 路径 | 体 / 说明 |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/me` | 当前用户 |
| GET | `/me/ssh-keys` | 列表 |
| POST | `/me/ssh-keys` | `{name,public_key}` → 201/409 |
| DELETE | `/me/ssh-keys/{id}` | 204 |
| GET | `/me/agent-pack` | 复制用 `{url,prompt,prefix}` |
| POST | `/me/agent-pack` | `{rotate:true}` 轮换 |

## 项目

| 方法 | 路径 | 体 / 说明 |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/projects` | 仅成员可见 |
| POST | `/projects` | `{name,slug,purpose}` slug=`[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*`；**purpose 必填** 2–80 字，一句话说清项目干什么，不要复述 name/slug |
| GET | `/projects/{id}` | |
| PATCH | `/projects/{id}` | `{name?,slug?,purpose?,budget_cpu_milli?,budget_mem_bytes?,budget_disk_bytes?}`；旧项目 `purpose` 为空时，必须先带 `purpose`，否则 409 `PURPOSE_REQUIRED` |
| DELETE | `/projects/{id}` | owner |
| GET | `/projects/{id}/usage` | |
| GET | `/projects/{id}/members` | |
| POST | `/projects/{id}/members` | `{username,role}` role=`admin\|developer\|viewer` |
| PUT | `/projects/{id}/members/{uid}` | `{role?,ssh_access?,ssh_mode?}` |
| DELETE | `/projects/{id}/members/{uid}` | |
| POST | `/projects/{id}/ssh-access-request` | 自己申请 |
| POST | `/projects/{id}/members/{uid}/ssh-access/approve` | admin |
| POST | `/projects/{id}/transfer-ownership` | `{new_owner_user_id}` |
| POST | `/projects/{id}/invitations` | `{email,role}` |
| POST | `/invitations/accept` | `{token}` 邮箱必须匹配；已是成员 409 |

`ssh_access`：`none` / `pending` / `granted` / `revoked`。`ssh_mode`：`read_write` / `read_only`。

## 工作区（机器）

| 方法 | 路径 | 体 / 说明 |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/workspaces` | `?project_id=` |
| GET | `/workspaces/{id}` | |
| POST | `/projects/{id}/workspaces` | `{name,plan,arch,visibility,runtime?,cpu_milli?,mem_bytes?,disk_bytes?}`；默认不写或 `container`（Docker Compose）；用户要 k8s 才 `runtime=k8s`。developer 一律 `requested`（含 k8s）；owner/admin 直建 |
| POST | `/workspaces/{id}/approve` | admin；`requested`→开通 |
| POST | `/workspaces/{id}/reject` | `{reason?}` |
| POST | `/workspaces/{id}/stop` `/start` | |
| POST | `/workspaces/{id}/resize` | `{cpu_milli,mem_bytes,disk_bytes}` |
| POST | `/workspaces/{id}/resize/approve` `/reject` | |
| POST | `/workspaces/{id}/destroy-request` | |
| POST | `/workspaces/{id}/destroy-request/approve` | 项目初审 |
| DELETE | `/workspaces/{id}` | 普通用户=申请销毁 |
| GET | `/workspaces/{id}/connection` | 含 `exec_example`（进机器用 exec，不要 ssh-config） |
| POST | `/workspaces/{id}/exec` | `{command, stdin_b64?, timeout_sec?}` → `{exit_code,stdout,stderr,via}`；权限同 SSH。**禁止在机器里构建**（`docker build` / `npm run build` / `go build` 等只允许本机） |
| GET | `/workspaces/{id}/ssh-target` | |
| GET | `/workspaces/{id}/terminal` | WebSocket；可 `?access_token=` |
| GET | `/workspaces/{id}/audit` | |
| GET | `/workspaces/{id}/kubeconfig` | 下载 ns 范围 kubeconfig（developer+） |
| POST | `/workspaces/{id}/k8s/apply` | `{yaml}`；强制改写 namespace，拒绝集群级对象。开通/apply 时把平台 auto_inject 仓库写成 Secret `ha-registry`。工作区非 running/fabric_degraded 时返回「未就绪」；集群未接返回 503 `K8S_UNAVAILABLE` |
| GET | `/workspaces/{id}/k8s/resources` | Deployment/Pod/Service 摘要；viewer 只读 |
| DELETE | `/workspaces/{id}/k8s/resources` | `?kind=&name=` |

`plan` 常用：`nano` `small` `2c2g` `medium` `large` `xlarge`。`arch`：`amd64` `arm64` `any`（`x86_64`/`aarch64` 会归一）。`visibility`：`shared` `private`。

状态人话：`requested` 待审批 / `provisioning` 开通中 / `running` 运行中 / `stopped` 已停止 / `failed` 失败 / `destroy_requested` 待项目审销毁 / `destroy_pending_platform` 待平台终审。

