| PATCH | `/admin/tls-certs/{id}` | `{auto_renew}`；到期前 30 天后台自动续 |
| GET | `/admin/dangerous-approvals` | staff |
| POST | `/admin/dangerous-approvals/{id}/approve` | 终审 |
| GET | `/users` `POST /users/batch` | admin |
| POST | `/users/{id}/suspend` `/unsuspend` `/reset-password` | admin |
| PATCH/DELETE | `/users/{id}` | admin |
| POST | `/allocations/{id}/release` | staff |

